# Missions: a deliver step (Marge's chowder to Captain Barnacle at Pier 39 in 90 s, no spills): no
# pickup place, so the clock starts with the step; delivered by teleport, his lines start at once.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start chowder 1
cmd 100 teleport 288 964 -7
run 200
expect event missionStep{mission=chowder,step=1,kind=deliver,seconds=90} within 1..1
expect event missionStep{mission=chowder,step=2,kind=talk} within 100..110
expect event talk{character=barnacle,line=chowder-06,n=0} within 100..110
expect no event missionFailed
